  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "At the end of the third white bone hall on Bai Gu mountain, Bai Ning Bing asks what Grey Bone Scholar’s lifebound Gu is before they smash the skull. Fang Yuan then smashes the corpse and takes a rank three Bone Spike Gu from the skull after the inheritance opens its preferred tunnel.",
        "chapters": [
          222
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_bai_gu_mountain",
          "char_bai_ning_bing",
          "char_grey_bone_scholar",
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Bai clan pursuers later find a bone spike Gu in the smashed skull as well.",
        "chapters": [
          223
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_bai_clan_bai_gu_mountain"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In Hei Fan grotto-heaven, which Fang Yuan now owns, one of the three Gu Immortal inheritances left on Immortal Succession Mountain still holds an Immortal Gu, Bone Spike, a bone path offensive Gu worm. Fang Yuan keeps every inheritance left on the mountain.",
        "chapters": [
          1132
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "bone-spike-immortal-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_hei_fan_grotto_heaven",
          "sys_gu_immortal",
          "loc_immortal_succession_mountain",
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "sys_attack_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan’s survey of his assets lists Bone Spike among his rank six Immortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1291
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "bone-spike-immortal-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He judges Bone Spike irrelevant to his present circumstances and counts it among three Immortal Gu of little use to him that he would rather trade away.",
        "chapters": [
          1293
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "bone-spike-immortal-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "At a trading convention Fang Yuan offers that bone path rank six Immortal Gu, and Wu Ma Yang takes it in exchange for rank six day Gu. Fang Yuan agrees to the exchange, calling the feeding of bone spike Immortal Gu a burden.",
        "chapters": [
          1299
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "bone-spike-immortal-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_day_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
